{
 "what": "REBOUND's TRACE integrator (REBOUND 5.2.2) on the 68 pieces of piece-check-mp.json (the pieces of the multiple shooting at the deepest witnessed step of t35 -, t44 -, t62 -, t72 - and the last stored step of t44 -: flagged, cross-checked, neighbours), against the 50 digit end states of piece-mp.py. G = 1, masses 1, the 12 start numbers of the piece, integrator 'trace', dt = tau / N, integrate(tau, exact_finish_time=1). Settings: a = defaults, N = 100; b = defaults, N = 1000; c = N = 1000 with peri_mode FULL_IAS15 (the values in use are in settings). D = the largest over the 12 components of |a - mp| / max(1, |mp|), as in piece-check-mp.json. TRACE treats particle 0 as the central body of a hierarchy; three equal masses without a dominant body are outside its design, so this is a test of TRACE outside its intended use, not of its quality in it. No matrix is compared: TRACE gives the end state only, the corrector needs the derivative.",
 "commands": [
  "python tools/piece-trace.py MPDIR OUT.json PIECE_ENDS1.json ... --compare data/deep/extra/piece-check-mp.json"
 ],
